l lot  of people who seem to be willing to  invest the time  I need to do that so I'm willing to do  that I've got some new channels that I  started this year one of them already  has a quite a few subscribers the  critical thinking logic and  argumentation channel i'll be adding  more videos to that as time goes on and  building that out like I've built up  this channel i also have a history of  philosophy channel that i haven't added  that much too but i will be later this  year so you know keep your eyes open for  that i'm going to be doing this for  years to come I've got a lot of really  cool projects planned beyond the  half-hour Hagel I'm thinking about doing  that sort of approach with other texts  like heidegger's being in time des  cartes meditations you know Aristotle's  metaphysics all sorts of things along  those those lines I'll be doing a lot  more core concept videos there's  existentialism videos get to shoot  there's a lot of cool content yet to  bring out but you know there's times is  the the factor there if I had 48 hours a  day I would actually be able to get as  much done as I want to get done but we  only get our 24 in any case once again  let me reiterate thanks to everybody who  has made this channel into a success  thanks to everybody who has subscribed  shared videos commented stick around I  hope that you'll stay engaged and that  you'll you know keep on commenting and  keep on sharing this stuff and that  you'll you know watch this for years to  come
 

